{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "custom_embedding",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "indices",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.int64",
          "device": "cpu",
          "shape": "[512, 512]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cpu",
          "shape": "[1000, 128]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[512, 512, 128]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 self.embedding(indices)：根据 indices 在 weight 中查找行向量，输出形状 [batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]；输入为 CPU，输出转移到当前 CUDA 设备；不支持 padding_idx，未使用 scale_grad_by_freq/sparse；输出按批量顺序连续排列。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "custom_baddbmm",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[512, 512, 128]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "batch1",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cpu",
          "shape": "[512, 512, 256]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "batch2",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cpu",
          "shape": "[512, 256, 128]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[512, 512, 128]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考 torch.baddbmm(x, batch1, batch2)：实现 x + batch1 @ batch2，batch1 和 batch2 在调用前需转移到 CUDA；beta=1, alpha=1（默认值），对每个 batch 执行矩阵乘加；输出形状与 x 相同；该算子不检查 batch1/batch2 的输入维度，仅按合同约定处理固定形状。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.embedding(indices)",
      "semantics": [
        "Embedding 查找：indices 为 [512,512] int64，weight 为 [1000,128] float32，输出 x 为 [512,512,128] float32 且位于 CUDA 设备；无 padding_idx，输出连续。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.baddbmm(x, batch1, batch2)",
      "semantics": [
        "torch.baddbmm 默认 beta=1, alpha=1，计算 x + batch1 @ batch2；batch1 [512,512,256]，batch2 [512,256,128]，输出 [512,512,128]；batch1 和 batch2 需从 CPU 转移到 CUDA，结果存储于 CUDA。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回经过 baddbmm 后的张量，形状 [512,512,128]，dtype float32，device cuda:0，stride 与 checkpoint 值一致。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}